  "description": "A fully managed implementation of a Xiph.org Foundation Ogg Vorbis decoder. Fork of NVorbis 0.10.5 (https://github.com/NVorbis/NVorbis) that decodes and seeks without allocating, with fixes for seeking inside the first and last pages.",
  "id": "ShyRed.NVorbis",
  "isPrerelease": true,
  "lastEdited": "2026-11-16T17:43:34.91Z",
